# Source-grounded exercise recipe: Wave I, Free Flow 10. The transcript asks
# the listener to arrive with a purpose already chosen, checks right-ear
# orientation, then names the preparatory order explicitly: Energy Conversion
# Box, Resonant Tuning, Resonant Energy Balloon, Affirmation and Focus 10.
#
# The tape is for a listener already comfortable with Discovery 1–5. It ends
# with the learned one-count waking return, represented by return-one rather
# than replacing it with the unrelated ten-to-one safety count. No generic
# briefing, Clear Skies or second open-exploration hold is inserted.

@title    Free Flow 10 — Your Own Purpose
@level    F10
@ending   return
@pan      right
@seed     10106
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use orientation

surf 0.30
use conversion-box

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon
use affirmation

surf 0.0
use relax-10
use free-flow-10
use return-one
